{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943390/extras/f5bfad74187e38061f58c5b1f86628aa.avif?t=1760403013\" data-has-big width=1560 height=624 /></span><strong>Welcome to popVirtue! </strong><i>popVirtue</i> is a VR Rhythm Dancing Game that involves utilizing both your hands and feet as you take up the stage. Dance to the rhythm of the music and feel what it\u2019s like to be the star of the stage \u2013 you\u2019re the main character of this universe! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943390/extras/7bf6a03a6ebdebc8e6c432239c925e98.avif?t=1760403013\" width=1509 height=513 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invite your friends and share the stage:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train mode,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side-by-Side mode,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versus mode,</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Karaoke Support \u2013 Sing along with on-screen lyrics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer\u00a0\u2013 Play with your friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice Mode \u2013 Rewind, Pause, and Mirror to perfect your moves,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay Mode \u2013 Review your best moments or figure out what may need some work,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Play Speed \u2013 Adjust how fast notes approach,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible Play Styles \u2013 Desktop, hands-only, or feet-only , or both.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skins - Customize your game to how you want it!,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beatmap Creation - Refer below:,</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Create Your Own Beatmaps</strong><br>Design &amp; share custom stages with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawn elements for personalized visuals,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snapshot Frames \u2013 Strike a pose!,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environment Changes to immerse yourself in the world of popVirtue,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps &amp; Obstacles for extra challenge,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more!,</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>PopVirtue</i> isn\u2019t just about dancing\u2014it\u2019s about <strong>owning the stage, your way</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943390?t=1760403013","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943390?t=1760403013","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943390/e1e840ba4187b4d638d26592a6bb82552fe51b68/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760403013","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943390/e1e840ba4187b4d638d26592a6bb82552fe51b68/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760403013","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943390/extras/f5bfad74187e38061f58c5b1f86628aa.avif?t=1760403013\" data-has-big width=1560 height=624 /></span><strong>Welcome to popVirtue! </strong><i>popVirtue</i> is a VR Rhythm Dancing Game that involves utilizing both your ha